OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to caretake waterpark
OL,4,Auntil sale completes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scarborough waterpark is being run by
OL,7,Fthe council while the sale of the
OL,8,Fattraction to a new owner is completed.
OL,10,FAlpamare, overlooking Scarborough's
OL,11,FNorth Bay, was taken over from Flamingo
OL,12,FLand by North Yorkshire Council on 1
OL,13,FNovember.
OL,15,FThe council announced a preferred
OL,16,Fbidder had been identified in September
OL,17,Ffollowing a "competitive marketing
OL,18,Fprocess", with the authority
OL,19,Fmaintaining the facility "in an
OL,20,Foperational condition" until it is
OL,21,Fformally handed over.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
